OL,3,GNEWSAPM says second Scottish
OL,4,Aindependence referendum remains 'off
OL,5,Alimits'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has told John Swinney that
OL,8,Fa second Scottish independence remains
OL,9,F"off limits" after speculation that he
OL,10,Fhad softened his stance on the issue.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, the prime minister told
OL,13,FMPs that both in Scotland and Northern
OL,14,FIreland a border poll would be
OL,15,Fconsidered if there was a clear
OL,16,Fconsensus and public opinion had
OL,17,Fchanged.
OL,19,FThat prompted Scotland's first minister
OL,20,Fto write to him, asking for a meeting
OL,21,Fto discuss how such a mechanism could
OL,22,Fbe enshrined in law.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
