OL,3,GNEWSAPM says second Scottish
OL,4,Aindependence referendum remains 'off
OL,5,Alimits'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut in his reply, Burnham said no
OL,8,Fconsensus currently existed and he
OL,9,Frepeated his view that another
OL,10,Freferendum was off limits while he
OL,11,Ffocuses on growing the economy and cost
OL,12,Fof living pressures.
